Package: datagenerator
Title: Generate Synthetic Datasets with Documented Provenance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Matthew", "Vanderbilt", , "rdy2dve@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates synthetic datasets from explicit, validated parameters.
    Every generator is reproducible from a seed, returns a tibble labelled as
    synthetic, and records the parameters that produced it. Stage 1 covers
    numeric, correlated, categorical, date, identifier, grouped, and
    missing-value structures. Synthetic data is not real data and must not be
    presented as observed evidence.
